 "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "公司主营业务为航空产品研发、制造、销售、维修与服务保障，主要产品包括航空防务装备、民用航空产品和智能测控产品；年报摘要未披露分产品收入占比。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "2025年分季度归母净利润Q3为1,256,306,602.29元、Q4为1,263,159,232.02元，Q4净利润略高于Q3，但Q4营业收入低于Q3。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}], "data_points": [{"name": "2025年营业收入", "value": "75,358,958,001.86", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "d74872371b3bba7caafb9a4f", "source_quote": "| 营业收入|75,358,958,001.86|1,779,761,71<br>0.30|65,054,925,106.17|15.84%|1,677,304,84<br>7.89|77,967,211,8<br>71.95|"}, {"name": "营业收入同比增长（调整后）", "value": "15.84", "unit": "%", "year": "2025年比2024年调整后", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "d74872371b3bba7caafb9a4f", "source_quote": "| 营业收入|75,358,958,001.86|1,779,761,71<br>0.30|65,054,925,106.17|15.84%|1,677,304,84<br>7.89|77,967,211,8<br>71.95|"}, {"name": "第三季度归母净利润", "value": "1,256,306,602.29", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第三季度", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "439a3ec2d3341e3a3ce9d9e1", "source_quote": "| 归属于上市公司股东的净利润|156,494,308.41|756,329,709.24|1,256,306,602.29|1,263,159,232.02|"}, {"name": "第四季度归母净利润", "value": "1,263,159,232.02", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第四季度", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232